			"notes": "DeadRecall 2.4.5\n\n- Adds dyeing, mixing and water-cauldron washing for all four normal backpack tiers.\n- Introduces reversible canonical item IDs for Remnant backpacks, the Automata copper wrench and all Alchemy items.\n- Preserves the existing `deadrecall:*` IDs for old worlds and migrates items lazily without discarding Data Components.\n- Bundles the exact SHA-512-pinned eight-module graph:\n  - TotemCore 0.2.0\n  - TotemRemnant 0.1.5\n  - TotemDiscordBridge 0.1.2\n  - TotemAutomata 0.1.7\n  - TotemAlchemy 0.1.5\n  - TotemEnchanting 0.1.1\n  - TotemVanillaTweaks 0.1.3\n  - TotemNexus 0.2.0\n\nInstall only the bundled DeadRecall JAR and Fabric API. Do not install the nested Totem modules again as separate JARs.\n\nValidation includes module GameTests, Java 25 production builds, nested-JAR SHA-512 verification and isolated Dedicated Server startup."
